/target
node_modules/
web/dist/

# Agent worktrees (F9.1). Eighteen of these were tracked as bare `160000` gitlinks
# with no .gitmodules, so a fresh clone got eighteen empty directories it could not
# populate, and every repo-wide `rg` returned ~5x duplicate hits from stale M3b-era
# copies of crates/, web/ and docs/. They are scratch space for parallel agent runs,
# not source. Ignoring them is also what restores one hit per match: ripgrep honours
# this file.
.claude/worktrees/
